body: |2-
  Funding! Evangelism!
  Skg might be:
  - A way to integrate minds (of either kind).
  - A way to change human nature.
  - A way for AI to feel more sense of self.
  Or maybe that's too advanced,
  and we should start with productivity arguments.
  I don't know.
